Universal Till original icons

The drawings in this folder are original artwork made for Universal Till
(ut-docs#4840). They were drawn from scratch on a 24x24 grid with stroke
width 2, round caps and joins; none is traced from or copied from any other
icon set (Lucide, Tabler, Phosphor, Iconoir, Font Awesome, Noun Project or
others).

They are licensed under the same terms as the rest of this repository: see
the Universal Till License in the LICENSE file at the repository root.
